			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Sarxas couldnt in any way sit on his chair and listen to this! He stands up! And talk load and clear!
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Now I havent been a leader! I havent been sitting around the table with the Gods! And I havent the answers in all situations! But I have been blessed with some wizdom from Brell that I gladly share (why should I else have been givin it). 
