Why and how I know this and could be sure to have been bleesed with it is another story thus! Bring me an Ale and I should tell you the deeper version of Sarxas Siaxovog! <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" />
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Now this is my point my Lady! If you dont take care of your family and your kids would growth up and became evil or at least not walk the thrue path! And you do a splended work as leader! Now will that be good? Will it be the will of the Gods? ehh? The only one I could think of that would have that strategy is Rallos Zek! No my freinds! The one (father or mother) that walks the path of our Gods are the one that take care of there own family and there own situations! And maby we will see a leader in glory, honor and sterngt in the future? You see the Gods have a slighty diffrent aspect of time than we mortal have <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" />
