			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Listening to coversation at the door, Qallain waits for his father to go back to the study. He nods at his mother, noting that he heard his father call out the visitor. He walks to the foyer, and grins wanly at Lamaridine. &quot;Hi... Didn't expect to see you around here... Sorry about his behaviour, but he's not one for visitors, especially friends of his &quot;wayward&quot; son.&quot; He looks down slightly embaressed. &quot;I take it there's something you wish to talk about, shall we find ourselves a quiet corner of Felwithe?&quot; With that, he opens the door, and holds it for Lamaridine.
<br />

<br />
 
<br />
Qallain Spirefell
<br />

<br />
