			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Looking about, Lamaridine steps through the door. &quot;Honestly,&quot; she says after a moment, &quot;If not here, then at my house, and if not there, then someplace safe and quiet that doesn't involve clerics, paladins or sorcerors poking about. It's not a good topic I have to discuss, Qallain, but you're the only person I trust talking to about this.&quot;
<br />

<br />
 
