				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Lamaridine sighs, and glances around, checking her surroundings, &quot;Well, yes, I'd like to say as little as possible, but you're right, my house isn't the best place to be discussing this. Perhaps the tavern? If we can keep it discreet then we should be fine. I'm not even sure what I'm seeing is anything more than conjecture and rumor...&quot; Her voice trails off as her eyes track movement along the horizon. Birds, that's all, she reassures herself, just birds. She looks back to Qallain with an expression he's rarely seen on his old friend's face- pure, undiluted doubt.  
