			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">&quot;Lama, what is it?&quot; He asks as he pulls her off into a childhood hiding spot? &quot;I've never seen you look so... Out of sorts before. Did you finally find something to help your mother?&quot; Concern etches Qallain's face as he waits for her to reply. 
