			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">After nodding the last group of students on rounds through their reports (all the same, nothing odd, nothing new- Tynkale was ready to fall over from boredom) the trainer headed to his offices to formulate a report of his own. Jyleel would certainly want to be made aware of Nishran's discovery, but with no other report to confirm it... he sighed deeply, rubbing his eyes in a gesture of weariness, and continued on, knowing that sleep was still hours away for him.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
 
<br />

