	<tr>
		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="9219"></a><b>Oathtender</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Supreme Majestrix of Pointy Things<br /><img src="images/Ranks/swords/mod6sword.gif" alt="Vizier" title="Vizier" border="0" /><br /><img src="images/avatars/gallery/general/allseeingeye.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Joined: 22 Aug 2002<br />Posts: 860<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=9219&amp;sid=8d6c0a228fcdcb196236f9adf71e85c3#9219"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Sun Sep 22, 2002 10:22 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=9219&amp;sid=8d6c0a228fcdcb196236f9adf71e85c3"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
